  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mr. Jacob once warned me to be wary of an entity he called \u2018the Shadows.\u2019
    These things, he said, lurk in darkness, prowling with a relentless madness.
    Once they start their chase, they won\u2019t stop until they\u2019ve caught you.
    I tried to ask Mr. Jacob more about them, but he stayed silent, either because
    he didn\u2019t know or because he simply wanted to avoid the topic.\n\nThere\u2019s
    something strange about the people in this mansion\u2014an unsettling mystery
    hangs over them. Just a word of advice: don\u2019t trust anyone blindly, and
    be careful who you choose to rely on.\n\n\n- Former Investigator"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
