--- !u!114 &595898935
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 595898934}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 37171f0ed2d9d3f49b2194e5c650a179, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 297769922}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 451501818}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1745817010}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 2001713966}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Wow! So this \u2018Shadow\u2019 is really dangerous!"
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "It\u2019s terrifying... I hope I never encounter them again. Now I understand
      why Mr. Jacob warned us never to go near the basement."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Mr. Jacob must know something more about these entities. Who is he, exactly?
      What\u2019s his background?"
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "Mr. Jacob is the head butler of the Hayes family. He oversees all the
      house\u2019s affairs and has served them since his youth. He even took care
      of milady when she was young."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "So, he\u2019s been around for a long time despite his age. (He must know
      more about the mysteries of this mansion... I have to talk to him, even if
      he might withhold information.) "
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Elana, where can we find Mr. Jacob? I\u2019d like to speak with him if
      possible."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "You want to meet Mr. Jacob? I\u2019m not sure\u2026 I rarely see him since
      he\u2019s always busy. But I think I know where he often works\u2014my coworkers
      sometimes spot him in the mansion's artifact room. We could find him there."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Perfect. Maybe he even knows something about Alice\u2019s disappearance."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "I hope he doesn\u2019t scold me for not finding milady yet\u2026 (nervously)"
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Don\u2019t worry. It\u2019s not your fault\u2014she disappeared without
      warning."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "Yeah\u2026 thanks for that."
  npcContButton: {fileID: 1965218949}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 1310360962}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1359844385}
  inventoryButton: {fileID: 141902397}
  pauseButton: {fileID: 1947168579}
