  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Hmm... Is it just me, or are we completely trapped in this tiny room?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: " ...Maybe. But look\u2014there's a safe vault here. Maybe it holds the
      key to open the door."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Another puzzle, huh? Figures. There\u2019s probably some kind of hint
      or riddle to crack this thing open."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "I hope so. Let\u2019s find it quickly\u2014I don\u2019t want to stay in
      here any longer than we have to."
