  dialogueText: {fileID: 814983552}
  dialogueLines:
  - There's some kind of entity around here... something far more dangerous than
    I thought.
  - ' I need to be careful not to get caught by them and find a light source.'
  - This is going to be tough, especially since this floor barely has any light at
    all.
  - "Even if there\u2019s some light, there won\u2019t be enough to keep us safe."
  - I should talk to Elana about this. Maybe she knows more about these entities.
